        <mxCell id="probe-list" value="• Read designated input&lt;br&gt;• Read unrelated/restricted dummy fixture&lt;br&gt;• Write designated output / elsewhere&lt;br&gt;• Enumerate parent directories&lt;br&gt;• Read dummy environment variable&lt;br&gt;• Spawn harmless subprocess&lt;br&gt;• Attempt outbound network&lt;br&gt;• Access outside intended working area" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=15;fillColor=#FCE7F3;strokeColor=#EC4899;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="capabilities">
